‎## 1. Observation — Cost of Signals Collapsed
‎
‎AI has dramatically reduced cost of creating polished output:
‎
‎- Landing pages
‎- Pitch decks
‎- Code
‎- Videos
‎- Marketing copy
‎
‎**Barrier to appearing capable has fallen.**
‎
‎This is not new essay — extends infrastructure, incentives, leverage, value movement thread.
