‎- Dispatch 013: Coding as evolutionary forest — tools change, who produces code changes
‎- Dispatch 018: Gate evaluation — users evaluating gate because surface polish no longer proof of underlying system
‎- Dispatch 021: Tractor Test — capability ≠ suitability — more powerful tool not necessarily better tool
